<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2424" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱμᾰτόεις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όεσσα</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όεν</span>, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱματοῦς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦσσα</span> (<i><span class="en">
			S.
			<u>OT</u>
			1279
		</span></i> cj.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱματηρός</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.82
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>blood-red</i>, or <i>of blood</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψιάδες, σμῶδιξ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				16
			</span></i>. 
			<i><span class="en">
				459
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.267
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>suffused with blood, flushed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥέθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					528
				</span></i>
			; of the petals of a rose, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.154
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>bloody, murderous</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμος</span>, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.650
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					698
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλαχαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					348
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
